  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Equal Access International - R&#xe9;silience pour la Paix</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal is to strengthen evidence-based policy responses to prevent violent extremism (VE) in northern C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire. By expanding R4P&#x2019;s Development &amp; Resilience Index to Violence Extremism (DRIVE) &#x2013; an index which captures communities&#x2019; stress factors and resilience capacity &#x2013; R4P will provide vital information to local, regional, national and international stakeholders to improve policy responses and projects. They will offer individualized support to various stakeholder groups to better grasp findings, understand analyses, and ultimately find ways to transform research into action.</narrative>
  </description>
